Here's another way of dealing with the rounding issue:

> counter<-0.10
> while (counter>0.05) {
+ cat("counter is at ", counter, "\n", sep="")

+ counter<-round(counter-0.01, 2)

+ }
counter is at 0.1
counter is at 0.09
counter is at 0.08
counter is at 0.07
counter is at 0.06

John

